<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-IAMA ends talks with Dairy Vale.</title>
<headline>RTRS-IAMA ends talks with Dairy Vale.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>IAMA Ltd said on Friday it had ended negotiations about the purchase of South Australian milk processor Dairy Vale Ltd's rural supplies business due to the failure to reach agreement on some key issues.</p>
<p>IAMA did not elaborate. Dairy Vale said it would pursue discussions with other parties.</p>
<p>IAMA said on August 26 it had begun talks with Dairy Vale about purchasing five stores in the Fleurieu Peninsula region of South Australia.</p>
<p>Dairy Vale is 46.2 percent owned by the Dairy Vale Investment Trust. -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
